LiquidTune (formerly Twelve for iOS)
A native iPhone and iPad music player that began as an unofficial port of the
Apache-2.0 licensed Twelve Android application.

Upstream: The LineageOS Project
https://github.com/LineageOS/android_packages_apps_Twelve
